  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Difference from **oír**: **escuchar** = to listen (deliberately, paying attention), **oír** = to hear (perceive sound, not necessarily on purpose)",
    "Common usage: *escuchar música* (to listen to music), *escuchar la radio* (to listen to the radio), *escúchame* (listen to me)"
